Package: service-provider-file-protocol-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: robotkernel-dev, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Robotkernel service provider to export file access services.
  This service provider gains unified access to files of robotkernel modules. 
  It support reading and writing.

